      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait really?? i'm kinda panicking. i've had these killer migraines for years and they always get really intense right before the weird stuff happens. my husband says i’m probably just overreacting because i'm stressed lately. are you sure it's not just a really bad aura? i've had auras where my vision gets blurry and my hands tingle before... wouldn't the speech thing just be part of that?",
