    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but honestly the hospital is so expensive and i'm just so tired of being told everything is an emergency when i know my own body. if i just take some extra strong migraine meds and lie down in a dark room for a few hours, can i just wait and see if the drooping goes away? like, if it's just an aura, shouldn't it resolve on its own pretty quickly once the headache peaks?",
