      "content": "Please do not try to self-treat or wait, as delaying care for a stroke can lead to permanent brain damage or death. Migraine auras typically spare lateral motor function and usually do not cause sudden, severe focal deficits like unaccoimpanied facial drooping alongside new speech issues. Since you have already experienced these specific symptoms, the risk of a life-thering emergency is too high to ignore your concerns about cost or past diagnoses. I urge you to call 911 immediately so a professional team can evaluate and stabilize you before any financial coverage becomes complicated.",
